# Wave W17-L (Meadowbrook Woods): shade turf — deep shade green, soft ground where sound goes to die, flecked with the coin-light that falls through the canopy (design: calm speckled grass in deep shade under tall trees). The Woods’ own ground — the darkest green in Maris, split from Holly Forest’s berry shade by its gold coin-light.
